{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cdb0d9b4-37b7-8957-85ae-1dbb13770174",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T18:22:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:20:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:20:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, Luis Medeiros. I know it's after hours for City Hall, I figured this was the line to try this evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:20:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you got the right one. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:21:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got water in the parking lot behind my building, 477 Ocean Avenue. The lot slopes toward the back door, so everything drains right to the entrance. After that snow turning to rain, the whole back is flooded."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:21:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, back lot, water running to the back door. How deep are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:21:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About up to the hubcaps on my car. It's been like that since the rain really picked up this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Hubcaps, back entrance. Is it getting inside, or just pooled at the door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:21:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right at the door now. Not inside yet, but it's close to the sill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:21:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is that the Ocean Drive side, past where the turn is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:21:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, you come down and turn at where the bank used to be, then it's the third building on the left."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:21:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, I'll note that. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:21:54-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0182. I'll send this to the crew supervisor for the morning list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:22:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do the crews work on weekends? In case it doesn't get done by then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:22:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do get called out when there's a storm, but it's mostly by priority. Tomorrow's a regular weekday, so it'll be in the queue then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:22:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm painting the spare bedroom tonight, a color called oatmeal, so I'm in and out of the house. If somebody knocks I'll hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:22:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Oatmeal, nice. I've got everything I need, Mr. Medeiros."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:22:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Kevin. Appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T18:22:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Take care."
    }
  ],
